<title>INDIA: India's Arvind Mills 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's Arvind Mills 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 1,274.05 vs  1,138.59</p>
<p>    Net sales		  8,946.39 vs  7,720.22</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)		4.50 vs	4.50</p>
<p>    Gross profit	     2,182.41 vs  1,663.33</p>
<p>    Interest		     154.49 vs     16.40</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 577.75 vs    481.52</p>
<p>    Tax			     54.15 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	121.97 vs     26.82</p>
<p>Note: Textiles firm The Arvind Mills Ltd said taxation on dividends for 1996/97 totalled 44.97 million rupees</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
